dsh-loop-dock is an independent community project for DeepSeek Harness.
It is not an official DeepSeek project and is not affiliated with or
endorsed by DeepSeek.

This repository vendors a derivative of the compiled lib/index.js from
@deepseek-ai/dsh-agent-loop 0.1.0-rc.6:

  vendor/dsh-agent-loop-headless/index.js

Upstream repository:

  https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

Upstream license and copyright are retained in:

  vendor/dsh-agent-loop-headless/LICENSE.upstream.txt

The full list of local modifications is in:

  vendor/dsh-agent-loop-headless/README.md

The vendored driver is used solely as the default turn/step driver behind
the dsh-loop-dock strategy-loop slots.

DeepSeek and DeepSeek Harness are names of their respective owner.
